            "review_title": "Review at La Vie En Rose",
            "review_text": "Sebastienvo\nCalifornia166 contributions\n0\nLuxury night out for couples\nDec 2015 • Couples\nI have been there in a short time cause of my friend invitation but this place is very luxury well decoration and crowded with most rich people. All look like the royal style and very entertainment with live music, nice trend and the drinks.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 25, 2015\nLaVieEnRose_HCMC\nDear Sebastienvo,\n\nThank you so much for your kind words on Tripadvisor. We are happy to know that you had a wonderful time at La Vie En Rose. We hope to see you again soon.\n\nWarm Regards,\nLa Vie En Rose Management Team\nRead more\nWritten July 5, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
